      "content": "thanks. looks like a solid start. one thing though—i'm a bit worried about the AV/tech section. in these big venues, sometimes things just don't go to plan, like a cable goes missing or a mic suddenly cuts out during the most important part. what should i include in the contingency plan to make sure we aren't caught off guard by those kinds of little hiccups?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
